{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Loksey's Journal adds 10 to Shadow Rage's hound haste effect (#1937)",
  "contract": "Loksey's Journal 504903 has E0 aura 107 (SPELL_AURA_ADD_FLAT_MODIFIER), MiscValue 12 (SPELLMOD_EFFECT2), BasePoints 9 / DieSides 1 = +10, class mask (0, 0x1000, 0); its description reads 'Shadow Rage now also grants your Shadow Hounds $s1% increased haste' = 10%. Both Shadow Rage records, 680275 and 804192, carry SpellFamilyFlags B 0x1000. Effect 1 of 804192 is the aura 138 (SPELL_AURA_MOD_MELEE_HASTE) with BasePoints -1 / DieSides 1 = 0, the slot the tooltip promises the 10% for ($504903m1), so the flat modifier must lift it from 0 to 10 through SpellEffectInfo::CalcValue -> Unit::ApplyEffectModifiers. SPELLMOD_EFFECT2 only touches effect index 1, so effects 0 and 2 are the controls. Deltas are measured relative to a snapshot so the scenario does not depend on the module's contract rewrite of the base amount.",
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "hunter",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 15,
      "level": 80
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
